# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Go build and test artefacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt

# NOTE: testdata/ is NOT ignored.
#
# `go test -fuzz` writes only *failing* inputs to testdata/fuzz/<Target>/, and
# those are regression cases: Go replays them on every plain `go test`. They
# must be committed. The much larger coverage-guided corpus lives in the build
# cache ($GOCACHE/fuzz) and is regenerated, so it is neither here nor tracked.
